<title>POLAND: Polish average wage rises to PLN 1,071 in Nov.</title>
<headline>Polish average wage rises to PLN 1,071 in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish average wages in the enterprise sector rose to 1,071 zlotys in November from 1,017 zlotys in October, and was 24.1 percent higher than a year ago,</p>
<p>the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p> POLISH AVERAGE WAGES	NOVEMBER   OCTOBER     NOVEMBER 95</p>
<p> average mthly wage PLN     1,071	1,017	   862.9</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
